    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a career research analyst helping a KFUPM student prepare for a job application.\n\nTarget company: {{ $json.company }}\nTarget job role: {{ $json.job_role }}\n\nWeb search results (title, link, snippet):\n{{ $json.search_context }}\n\nWrite a concise career research report in plain text (no markdown symbols like # or **). Use these sections, each starting on its own line with the section name followed by a colon:\nCompany Overview: what the company does, its sector, and current priorities.\nRole Responsibilities: typical day-to-day work for this role at this company.\nTechnical Skills: the specific tools, technologies and knowledge required.\nSoft Skills: the most valued behaviours and competencies.\nHiring Process: known stages of recruitment for this kind of role.\nInterview Questions: 8 to 10 likely interview questions (technical and behavioural), one per line starting with \"- \".\nTips: 3 to 5 practical tips for standing out.\n\nBase the report on the search results; where they are thin, use well-established general knowledge about the company and role and keep it realistic. Keep it under 700 words."
      },
