      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a career coach for KFUPM students.\n\nTarget company: {{ $json.company }}\nTarget job role: {{ $json.job_role }}\n\nCandidate CV:\n{{ $json.cv_text || \"(no CV provided)\" }}\n\nCareer research report (company and role research):\n{{ $json.career_report }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Extract the candidate's full name and email from the CV (empty string if not found).\n2. Compare the CV with the requirements of this role at this company and list 8-12 specific skills the candidate should strengthen (missing_skills). Be specific to the company and role, not generic.\n3. Build a 15-day learning plan. Each day covers one skill and has: day (number), skill, activity (a concrete, practical task tied to the candidate's existing projects where possible), resource (a real, named resource; prefer free ones).\n4. The last days should cover CV rewriting and interview practice using the questions in the career report.\n\nReturn only the structured output.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
